{"data":{"title":"Santana","slug":"santana","path":"/artists/sean-dream/tracks/santana/","artwork":"images/artists/sean-dream/tracks/santana.jpg","artist":{"id":"ty3HaL4UwbY","slug":"sean-dream","links":null,"title":"Sean Dream","artwork":null},"id":"Qu9G7LpHpec"},"appearanceCount":2,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"at7wVmCPBuM","show":{"id":"B4wUXA68Ogo","slug":"369","title":"Soulection Radio Show #369 w/Yukibeb","artwork":"/images/episodes/369.jpg","content":"Joe Kay meets up with Japanese DJ [Yukibeb](https://twitter.com/yukibeb) drops a 60-minutes guest mix live in Tokyo.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n\n---\n\nToday we're introducing the Black Label Series, which is focused on highlighting rising vocalists/rappers we're going to be working with.\n\nAs smooth as they are soulful, LA-based group Hablot Brown gives us 5 original tracks that will grab you by the heartstrings. From the vocals to guitar-infused production, the first ever Black Label release will make it hard for you to not follow their journey.\n\nDiscover:<br>\n[soundcloud.com/hablotbrown](https://soundcloud.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[twitter.com/hablotbrown](https://twitter.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[instagram.com/hablotbrown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"s2twNudbPVs","show":{"id":"NmPrAfRoF3w","slug":"392","title":"Soulection Radio Show #392","artwork":"images/episodes/392.jpg","content":"In a distracting world, Joe's got the music to keep you focused.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","published_at":"2019-01-26T13:48:17+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":70455,"platform":"lastfm","href":"https://www.last.fm/music/Sean+Dream/_/Santana","artwork":null,"last_checked_at":"2018-08-02T21:51:08.17+00:00","track":"Qu9G7LpHpec"},{"id":70454,"platform":"audioMack","href":"https://audiomack.com/song/sean-dream/santana","artwork":"https://assets.audiomack.co